  "description": "Suho has a problem. No, it’s not the fact that he has severe social withdrawal. It’s that he’s head over heels for Sanghyeok, the hot new security guard working at Suho’s apartment complex. After falling in love at first sight, Suho starts scheming and making excuses to hover around Sanghyeok at all times. The thing is, this only causes Sanghyeok to misunderstand Suho as a creep. Sanghyeok is already quiet and cautious for reasons unknown, and Suho’s antics are not helping! Can Suho clear up the misunderstanding and ask him out? \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
